msgid "PARMS connects you to real-time parking availability across thousands of locations. Book, pay, and park — from one calm, simple platform."
msgstr "PARMS ikuhuza n'ahantu ho guhagarara imodoka mu bihe byose. Bika, wishyure uhagarare — ukoresheje urubuga rumwe rworoheje."

