# Features section
msgid "Everything you need to park smarter"
msgstr "Byose ukeneye guhagarara neza"

msgid "From real-time availability to automated billing — PARMS handles every aspect of your parking experience without friction."
msgstr "Kuva ku makuru y'igihe nyacyo kugeza ku bwishyu bwa kazi — PARMS ikurikirana byose ku guhagarara imodoka yawe nta ngorane."

msgid "Real-time Availability"
msgstr "Amakuru y'igihe nyacyo"

msgid "See live space counts across all locations. No refresh needed — the data comes to you."
msgstr "Reba umubare w'ahantu hafungutse mu bihe byose. Nta gukanda nanone — amakuru yaza kukuri."

msgid "Instant QR Tickets"
msgstr "Indagisho za QR zo gutura"

msgid "Generate and scan QR-coded parking tickets in seconds. No paper, no queues."
msgstr "Kora ukasuzuma indagisho za QR mu masegonda make. Nta mpapuro, nta murunga."

msgid "Smart Payments"
msgstr "Kwishyura neza"

msgid "Pay via MTN Mobile Money, PayPal, or card. Fee calculated on actual time parked."
msgstr "Ishyura ukoresheje MTN Mobile Money, PayPal, cyangwa ikarita. Igiciro gibarwa ku gihe nyacyo."

msgid "Analytics Dashboard"
msgstr "Ikibaho cy'imibare"

msgid "Revenue tracking, occupancy rates, and detailed usage reports — all in one view."
msgstr "Gukurikirana amafaranga, igipimo cy'imikoreshereze, n'raporo zirambuye — byose mu buryo bumwe."

msgid "Secure by Design"
msgstr "Ufite umutekano"

msgid "Role-based access, encrypted data, and full audit logging built in from the start."
msgstr "Uburenganzira bufatiye ku nshingano, amakuru acumbikiwe, n'inyandiko z'igenzura zuzuye kuva ntangiriro."

msgid "Mobile First"
msgstr "Terefone mbere"

msgid "Find parking, view history, manage vehicles — fully optimised for your phone."
msgstr "Shaka parking, reba amateka, genzura imodoka — yateguwe neza ku terefone."

# How it works
msgid "Three steps to parked"
msgstr "Intambwe eshatu zo guhagarara"

msgid "PARMS is designed to get out of your way. Find, book, and park — then get on with your day."
msgstr "PARMS yateguwe kugira ngo ikurehere. Shaka, bika, uhagarare — nuko ukomeze umunsi wawe."

msgid "Search & Discover"
msgstr "Shakisha no Kumenya"

msgid "Browse available parking lots near your destination with live slot counts and pricing."
msgstr "Shakisha ahantu ho guhagarara hafi y'aho ugende n'umubare w'ahantu hafungutse n'ibiciro bya kazi."

msgid "Book Your Space"
msgstr "Bika Ahantu Hawe"

msgid "Reserve a space in seconds. Your QR-coded ticket is ready before you even start driving."
msgstr "Fata ahantu mu masegonda make. Indagisho yawe ya QR iteguye mbere yo gutangira gutwara."

msgid "Park & Pay"
msgstr "Hagarara no Kwishyura"

msgid "Scan your QR code at the gate. Payment is calculated automatically on exit."
msgstr "Suzuma kode ya QR ku irembo. Kwishyura bibarwa by'akazi iyo usohotse."

# CTA section
msgid "Ready to park smarter?"
msgstr "Witeguye guhagarara neza?"

msgid "Join thousands of drivers who save time every day with PARMS."
msgstr "Injira mu bagabuzi ibihumbi bavunana igihe buri munsi bakoresheje PARMS."

msgid "Create free account"
msgstr "Fungura konti ubuntu"

msgid "Talk to us"
msgstr "Tuganire"

# Mobile App + Team
msgid "Mobile App"
msgstr "Porogaramu ya terefone"

msgid "Take PARMS wherever you go"
msgstr "Twara PARMS aho ugiye hose"

msgid "Download the app for instant parking search, ticket generation, and payment — right from your pocket."
msgstr "Pakurura porogaramu yo gushaka parking, gukora indagisho no kwishyura — mu nkweto yawe."

msgid "Our team"
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu"

msgid "The people behind PARMS"
msgstr "Abantu bari inyuma ya PARMS"

# Footer
msgid "Smart parking management for modern cities. Find and book effortlessly."
msgstr "Gucunga parkage neza mu mujyi wa none. Shaka ubike nta ngorane."

