# Contact page
msgid "Get in touch"
msgstr "Twandikire"

msgid "We'd love to hear from you. Send us a message and we'll respond as soon as possible — usually within 24 hours."
msgstr "Byatwurjisha gutuganirira. Turongere ubutumwa kandi tuzagusubiza vuba — muri rusange mu masaha 24."

