msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Ibibazo bikunze kubazwa"

msgid "Quick answers to common questions"
msgstr "Ibisubizo byihuse ku bibazo bisanzwe"

msgid "How does PARMS work?"
msgstr "PARMS ikora bite?"

msgid "PARMS connects you with real-time parking availability across registered lots. Search for your destination, view available spaces, book instantly, and pay — all in one place."
msgstr "PARMS ikuhuza n'ahantu hafungutse mu bihe byose mu maparking yanditswe. Shakisha aho ugiye, reba ahantu hafungutse, bika ako kanya, wishyure — byose ahantu hamwe."

msgid "Is PARMS available 24/7?"
msgstr "PARMS iraboneka 24/7?"

msgid "Yes. PARMS runs around the clock, and our support team is available whenever you need help — day or night."
msgstr "Yego. PARMS ikora iminota yose, kandi itsinda ryacu ry'ubufasha riraboneka igihe cyose ukeneye ubufasha — umurango cyangwa nijoro."

msgid "What payment methods are accepted?"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kwishyura bubiwe ni ubuhe?"

msgid "We accept MTN Mobile Money, PayPal, major credit/debit cards, and cash payments at the lot. More methods are being added regularly."
msgstr "Twakira MTN Mobile Money, PayPal, ikarita nkuru zo kwishyura, n'amafaranga asanzwe ku maparking. Uburyo bwindi bwongerwa kenshi."

msgid "Can I cancel or modify a booking?"
msgstr "Nshobora guhagarika cyangwa guhindura kubika?"

msgid "Yes — active bookings can be managed from your dashboard. If you have trouble, contact our support team and we'll assist you promptly."
msgstr "Yego — kubika gushoboka bishobora gucungwa ukoresheje ikibaho cyawe. Niba ufite ingorane, wamagana itsinda ryacu ry'ubufasha kandi tuzakufasha vuba."

