# Testimonials
msgid "Testimonials"
msgstr "Ibisobanuro by'ababigira serivisi"

msgid "What drivers are saying"
msgstr "Ibi abayobozi bavauga"

msgid "PARMS has made finding parking so much easier. I book ahead and know exactly where to go. No more circling the block."
msgstr "PARMS yamukiye gahunda yo gushaka ihindagiza. Ndahoze mbigize ahigiye kandi nzi neza aho nzambuza. Ntakindi gatiro k'ibicara."

msgid "Software Developer"
msgstr "Umushyi wa porogaramu"

msgid "Simple, reliable, and effective. The app is user-friendly and finding parking is genuinely no longer stressful."
msgstr "Yoroshye, itekanwaho, kandi ifungura. Applikiyoni irakora neza kandi gushaka ihindagiza ntibikora inzira."

msgid "Business Owner"
msgstr "Wacu wa ubwigenge"

msgid "The QR ticket system is exactly right. I scan and go — no fumbling for paper tickets or dealing with attendants."
msgstr "Sisitemu ya QR ticket ni nzira nziza. Ndascanye kandi ndamuva — nta kibazo cya tiketi za papiyeri."

msgid "Nurse, Kigali"
msgstr "Muganga w'indwara, Kigali"

